  m_Name: TheToll
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: thetoll
  displayName: The Toll
  description: Every way north crosses Troll Valley's river, and the oldest bridge of all, at the valley's head, belonged to something the trolls themselves pay. Nobody at home has seen it and come back. Find the head of the valley on an expedition, see what is left on that bridge, and come home with the way.
  chain: The Hearth and the Door
  journalNotes: 'The bridge nearest the valley''s head: the portal can''t see past it. Cross it, look at what is camped on the far bank, then get out alive: a way the portal hasn''t seen brought home doesn''t count.


    The toll-takers at the other bridges say it is the Brukam''s, and that even they pay him.'
